#: native/src/nijigenerate/utils/crashdump_posix_notify.cpp:30
msgid ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"===   nijigenerate has crashed   ===\n"
"Please send us the nijigenerate-crashdump.txt file in your log directory, "
"XDG_STATE_HOME. For Flatpak, this is in ~/.var/app/"
"nijigenerate.nijigenerate.\n"
"Attach the file as a git issue @ https://github.com/nijigenerate/"
"nijigenerate/issues"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"===   nijigenerate ist abgestürzt   ===\n"
"Bitte senden Sie uns die nijigenerate-crashdump.txt Datei in Ihrem Log "
"Ordner, XDG_STATE_HOME. Für Flatpak, ist das in ~/.var/app/"
"nijigenerate.nijigenerate.\n"
"Hängen Sie die Datei als Git Issue an https://github.com/nijigenerate/inochi-"
"nijigenerate/issues"

